    "text": "Hints: <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/WBDmK1PFDhgf7WOSS1BrWlc-ypJcgkwoAYntKCEMbgY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}} \\mathrm{V}^\\gamma=\\left(2 \\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{i}}\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{V}}{2}\\right)^\\gamma \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{f}}}{\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{i}}}=2\\left(\\frac{\\gamma}{2 \\gamma}\\right)^\\gamma=2(2)^{-\\gamma} \\\\\n& =2 \\times 0.38=0.76 \\\\\n&\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
